Body:
It's probable because of the built-in `clang-format` formatter (opencode.ai/docs/formatters), do you have a `.clang-format` config file? Or try disabling it:

```json
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "formatter": {
    "clang-format": {
      "disabled": true
    }
  },
}
```
